sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User / Browser Client
    participant Viewer as Frontend (AnimationPlayer)
    participant API as FastAPI Backend (/api/*)
    participant Adapter as MotionBricks Adapter
    participant Recon as G1 Reconstructor
    participant Retarget as Retargeting Engine

    alt Mode A: Offline Fixture Playback
        User->>Viewer: Open Viewer / Click Play
        Viewer->>Viewer: Fetch local sample_motion.json
        Viewer->>Viewer: In-browser Schema Validation
        Viewer->>Viewer: Slerp Frame Evaluation
        Viewer->>User: Render 3D Humanoid Locomotion
    else Mode B: Real MotionBricks Inference
        User->>API: POST /api/inference/generate {command: "walk", duration: 2.0}
        API->>Adapter: Check checkpoints availability
        alt Checkpoints Missing / LFS Pointers
            Adapter-->>API: Status: Checkpoints unpulled (~2.3GB LFS)
            API-->>User: HTTP 503 Service Unavailable (with git lfs pull command)
        else Checkpoints Present & Verified
            API->>Adapter: Run predict(global_root, local_poses)
            Adapter->>Recon: Reconstruct G1Skeleton34 frames from [T, 414]
            Recon-->>Adapter: List of ReconstructedG1Frame
            Adapter->>Retarget: Retarget G1 to VRM Humanoid
            Retarget-->>API: CanonicalHumanoidMotion/v1 Document
            API-->>Viewer: HTTP 200 JSON Response
            Viewer->>Viewer: Play and evaluate on VRM avatar
            Viewer-->>User: Render real-time generated motion
        end
    end
